# Tracer: native mathematical constants
#
# Before (Litex verified, but compiler emission stopped):
# e = e
# Former compiler behavior: fail closed at the unsupported source object `e`,
# even though the verifier retained exact native-constant membership evidence.
#
# Now: `i`, `e`, and `pi` lower to native Mathlib complex terms. Base-carrier
# memberships replay exact verifier-selected certificates through proved rules.
i = i
e = e
pi = pi

i $in C
e $in R
pi $in R
e $in C
pi $in C

# Boundary (Litex verifies; compiler remains fail-closed):
# e $in R+
# Positive-real membership needs the exact refined carrier and its positivity
# predicate. This batch must not erase that predicate or reuse plain `R`.
#
# Evidence:
# target/release/litex -compact -strict -runner -f lean/examples/19_NativeConstants.lit
# cargo test --release --test litex_to_lean_compiler_tracers native_constants
# cd lean && ./compiler.sh check examples
